<title>BELGIUM: Belgian industrial output unchanged yr/yr 92.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian industrial output unchanged yr/yr 92.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Statistics Office released the following indices for production in industry excluding the construction sector -</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	    Jan 97     Dec 96	   Jan 96</p>
<p> work day index (1990=100) (*)   92.7	 96.5	     92.7</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) index per working day, adjusted for length and composition of the months  </p>
<p> SEASONALLY ADJUSTED INDICES(*) Jan 97     Dec 96	   Jan 96</p>
<p> industry as a whole		 94.5	 94.6	     94.3</p>
<p> construction industry	     76.1	 76.7	     79.0</p>
<p> investment goods		    99.8	 99.7	     99.9</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) seasonally adjusted based on averages of the last 12 months.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
